WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:05.428
- There's just so much
that was left unsaid.

00:00:05.428 --> 00:00:07.889
- Sorry, man, breakups are hard.

00:00:07.889 --> 00:00:10.148
- I just miss her.

00:00:10.148 --> 00:00:12.100
- Has she called you back?

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.091
- She doesn't have opposable thumbs.

00:00:15.091 --> 00:00:20.091
(slow music)

00:00:25.572 --> 00:00:27.109
Hey, is it cool if I sit here?

00:00:27.109 --> 00:00:29.547
There's like, no other spots anywhere.

00:00:29.547 --> 00:00:30.764
- Yeah.
- [Brunette] Cool.

00:00:30.764 --> 00:00:32.250
I'm on my last Canto.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:34.417
- Are you kidding me?

00:00:34.417 --> 00:00:35.830
- Wow, we're the only two people

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:37.479
in Los Angeles reading Dante.

00:00:37.479 --> 00:00:39.199
- I'm Mary.
- [Brunette] Brittany.

00:00:39.199 --> 00:00:41.447
- [Both] Nice to meet you.

00:00:42.363 --> 00:00:44.917
- It's not funny, like it says it is.

00:00:44.917 --> 00:00:46.269
(Mary laughs)

00:00:46.269 --> 00:00:51.269
(wistful music)

00:00:55.417 --> 00:00:57.627
Hi.
- [Mary] Oh, one sec.

00:00:57.627 --> 00:00:59.838
Oh, by the way, this is my dog Laura.

00:00:59.838 --> 00:01:01.765
- Oh, you have a dog.
- [Mary] Yeah.

00:01:01.765 --> 00:01:03.949
- [Brittany] Cool.

00:01:03.949 --> 00:01:06.950
We weren't always that into each other.

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:11.950
(hip music)

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:25.694
- Oh shit, I gotta get to work.

00:01:25.694 --> 00:01:26.581
- Okay.
- [Mary] Hey, do you

00:01:26.581 --> 00:01:28.652
mind watching Laura for a few hours?

00:01:28.652 --> 00:01:31.532
She's super easy, just like, one walk.

00:01:31.532 --> 00:01:32.353
- Okay.

00:01:32.353 --> 00:01:33.584
- I'll see you later.
- [Brittany] Okay.

00:01:33.584 --> 00:01:34.934
Bye, hon.

00:01:39.839 --> 00:01:42.072
Who you voting for?

00:01:42.072 --> 00:01:43.836
Seem like a Sanders.

00:01:43.836 --> 00:01:46.142
You like go for a walk or ...

00:01:47.538 --> 00:01:50.862
Guess we're gonna go for a walk.

00:01:50.862 --> 00:01:54.090
But then, something changed.

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:59.090
(upbeat music)

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:06.888
We couldn't get enough of each other.

00:02:06.888 --> 00:02:09.186
Yeah, sure, okay, bye.

00:02:09.186 --> 00:02:13.517
My little Laura, I love
you so much. (mumbles)

00:02:13.517 --> 00:02:16.282
You're a good girl, okay, bye.

00:02:18.076 --> 00:02:21.530
(screams from TV)

00:02:22.513 --> 00:02:27.513
(upbeat music)

00:02:41.476 --> 00:02:43.533
- Brittany, what the fuck?

00:02:43.533 --> 00:02:44.623
- What?

00:02:44.623 --> 00:02:46.248
- What, is that Laura?

00:02:46.248 --> 00:02:47.990
- Yeah, you like it?

00:02:47.990 --> 00:02:51.171
But then, things got really hard.

00:02:51.171 --> 00:02:54.940
- It's just, it's not working for me.

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:56.662
- I get it.

00:02:57.991 --> 00:02:59.686
Laura, don't look at me like that.

00:02:59.686 --> 00:03:01.822
- Get a grip, Brittany.

00:03:01.822 --> 00:03:04.079
- Guess I'll go.

00:03:04.079 --> 00:03:06.540
Oh, and you shit in my shoe?

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:09.126
Real mature, Laura, real fucking mature.

00:03:09.126 --> 00:03:11.360
- Oh my god.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:16.360
(sad music)

00:03:18.006 --> 00:03:21.047
- But then came the drinking.

00:03:21.047 --> 00:03:22.538
And the jealousy.

00:03:22.538 --> 00:03:25.216
Who the fuck is she?

00:03:25.216 --> 00:03:30.216
(sad music)

00:03:38.979 --> 00:03:41.633
(screams from TV)

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:46.074
And that's what happened.

00:03:46.074 --> 00:03:47.193
- Damn.

00:03:47.193 --> 00:03:48.702
Well, you know what they say.

00:03:48.702 --> 00:03:50.026
- To the world, you may be one person,

00:03:50.026 --> 00:03:52.325
but to a doggie, you may be the world?

00:03:52.325 --> 00:03:55.459
- No, time heals all wounds.

00:03:55.459 --> 00:03:58.338
- Oh, no I haven't heard that one.

00:03:58.338 --> 00:03:59.639
- It's a pretty common phrase.

00:03:59.639 --> 00:04:01.431
- It's not one.

00:04:01.431 --> 00:04:02.317
- Okay.

00:04:02.317 --> 00:04:04.918
- Come on, baby, come on.

00:04:04.918 --> 00:04:05.898
Hey.
- [Brittany] Oh.

00:04:05.898 --> 00:04:07.036
- How are you?

00:04:07.036 --> 00:04:07.910
- [Mary] Good to see you.

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:08.944
- Good to see you, too.
- [Mary] Yeah.

00:04:08.944 --> 00:04:09.685
You've been well?

00:04:09.685 --> 00:04:11.296
- I'm good.
- [Brittany] Awesome, cool.

00:04:11.296 --> 00:04:12.777
- How are you?

00:04:12.777 --> 00:04:13.696
- I'm good.

00:04:13.696 --> 00:04:15.027
- Cool.
- [Brittany] Whoa.

00:04:15.027 --> 00:04:17.581
Oh, hey Laura.

00:04:17.581 --> 00:04:19.037
You look good.

00:04:19.037 --> 00:04:20.543
I like this collar.

00:04:20.543 --> 00:04:21.489
- It's a new one.
- [Brittany] I like that.

00:04:21.489 --> 00:04:23.303
- Thanks.

00:04:23.303 --> 00:04:24.300
- Well, good to see you.
- [Mary] Anyway, yeah.

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:25.629
- [Brittany] We should get
coffee or something soon.

00:04:25.629 --> 00:04:28.031
- Totally awesome to see you.
- [Brittany] Cool, okay.

00:04:28.031 --> 00:04:33.031
(wistful music)

00:04:40.827 --> 00:04:44.123
Then I found out about an
offshore bank account she had.

00:04:44.123 --> 00:04:45.299
- What?

00:04:45.299 --> 00:04:47.189
- Not the girlfriend.

00:04:47.189 --> 00:04:49.207
For her dog.

00:04:49.207 --> 00:04:51.935
- There we go. (both laugh)

